The Atlantis Guardian is not a [[Seekers|Seeker]], but in actuality a magical trap with the power to open the gate of the Casterwill compound of the city of Atlantis by the click of his fingers, preventing anyone from entering the compound. This gate could send a Titan back to their Amulet if they closed on one, as seen with [[Anubian]]. The Guardian appears to follow the orders of whoever passed the tests on whether to open or close the gate. He also had the power to create sentient beings such as [[Mermen]], which he inserted into the Test of Prowess. He possesses deep knowledge in Casterwill history, particularly on the war against the Nullifiers. {{Source|Coming of Age}}  
